# loop-lore environment overrides
# Bun auto-loads .env from the project root at startup.
# Every config path maps to an ENV var (dot.path uppercased, e.g. headers.xFrameOptions -> HEADERS_X_FRAME_OPTIONS).
# Only set the variables you need; unset vars fall back to config file / defaults.

# AGEGATE_ENABLED=
# AGEGATE_MINIMUMAGE=
# AGEGATE_MODE=
